{"seq":15,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-none-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T05:34:09.537Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"786e70016ef7ed28bbe363d258497ffcdb704f4f4ac75642c413fceb5da90fc8","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here's what Moss's Strategic digests show. Only Vantorre Group and Vantorre Mobility are stated outright.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's account from the July 2025 MSA, and it moved to Gideon on **4 May 2026**. Two digests give that date. The 5/3 Sunday prep says \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest says \"Effective 2026-05-04, Nadia's old industrial account has been reassigned\". The 8/3 digest calls it \"Gideon's biggest account\".\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The 7/7/25, 12/1/25 and 4/27/26 digests all call it Gideon's fleet account. The 5/4/26 digest says he \"also assumed management\" of it that day, which sits oddly with those earlier ones. It's Gideon either way.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, but only by inference. The latest digest (9/30) says \"Gideon's medical account\" and separately lists Orlavine at 55 seats. It never links the two by name. In March 2025 the medical account was Nadia's, and by 12/1/25 it was Gideon's. The digests don't give a handover date. Please confirm with Gideon before it goes on the slide.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** The digests don't name an owner. They only call it \"the Strategic pod's outdoor/retail account\". Nadia is hosting a training session for them, but that doesn't tell us she owns the account. I'd check the CRM or ask Nadia and Gideon rather than guess.\n\nThe digests are the only source I used, and the latest is 9/30. Any change since then wouldn't show up here."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
